!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/valid/a-tag-naming-a-variant-extern-places-the-value-by-its-selectors-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.13, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.9, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4"
  description: """
    At `( ticket_v1 | ticket_v2 )` the tag names a variant, and a tag naming the position's extern says no more than
    the position does: the value is read as an untagged one at the target, an abstract `ticket` naming the selector
    `kind`, so it is placed by its members under the foreign schema. `kind: urgent` places the value at `ticket_v1`
    at extern-family-1.tn's `urgent`, which declares `by`, and at `ticket_v2` at extern-family-2.tn's, which
    declares `lane`.
    """
  valid: _
}
